window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>House Trelane has survived a conspiracy that threatened the Family’s existence, but a tragic accident cuts their celebration short.</b><br> <br> Cressa wakes from an accident with her memories gone. She only has the word of an ancient and attractive vampire that she is his Blood Ward—a human in training to become a vampire. The mystery of how or why that happened might forever be out of her reach.<br> <br> Devon rages. His greatest enemy has taken something most precious from him. No other mission is as vital as bringing Cressa home. And he’ll use every resource available to House Trelane to make that happen.<br> <br> But first, he has to find her.<br> <br> The fastest path to Cressa is through her dreams, and it will require the aid of someone so powerful, they have the ability to invade a vampire’s dreams.</p>"; 
